  "sourceAuthority": "Pinned Java controllers, DTOs, response factory and engine state constants. API documentation does not override these native 8.0.0 source semantics.",
  "findings": [
    "Native PlanItemInstanceResource accepts trigger, enable, disable and start only; enable invokes startPlanItemInstance.",
    "CaseInstanceResource PUT distinguishes evaluateCriteria from nonempty name/businessKey updates; DELETE at the same path terminates and retains history.",
    "Deployment name/key are parsed from the original query string; one CMMN/XML or BAR/ZIP file is processed upstream.",
    "Runtime TaskResponse and historic response factory set caseInstanceId/caseDefinitionId only when native scopeType is cmmn; raw shared task rows remain complete.",
    "Variable instance responses retain native caseInstanceId, taskId and planItemInstanceId; original valueUrl binary resources are retained without deserialization.",
    "Native collection pagination is not a transactional snapshot. Total changes, duplicate IDs or premature termination fail the capture rather than imply completeness.",
    "Unknown criteria/trigger responses are not attributed from generic history changes. No native mutation is replayed by this module."
  ],
